== Technical treatment ==
{{:Neural processing unit/Technical}}

== Scope and boundaries ==
An NPU may be integrated into a system-on-chip or attached as a separate accelerator. Host processors typically handle application control, operating-system functions, and operations that an NPU does not support. NPUs overlap with GPUs, DSPs, and other tensor accelerators in the calculations they can run; distinctions depend on each implementation's supported operators, programmability, memory system, compiler and intended workload.

